        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifCompositeProfile.xasDocument.XasDocument.comment" xmi:uuid="be97d748-dc77-5f82-acbc-01d082db0dec">
          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

CDIF document-level profile for X-ray Absorption Spectroscopy datasets. Composes the four base CDIF 1.1 profiles (core, discovery, data description, data structure) with the two XAS extensions (xasCore mandatory, xasOptional recommended) so a conforming document is discoverable, describes its measured variables, describes its physical/tabular structure, and carries the XAS-specific metadata that lets a domain client interpret the spectrum.
:title: "CDIF XAS document profile"
:prefix: ``xas``
:noId:
:extends:
:noOwnSchema:</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifCompositeProfile.xasDocument.XasDocument"/>
        </ownedComment>
